{
 "title": "Scrollbar grab zone (Lawrence 2026-11-20, msg 42498: \"it is possible for me to hover close, and for the width to change, but after i mousedown and drag, it fails to scroll\"). A 260 pt sidebar with 45 workspaces in a 1100 x 760 window: column by column from 236 to 260 (the sidebar's trailing edge is in debug.layers' sidebar_resize_area_in_window), the pointer on the scroller's knob, then a press and a 240 pt drag down. Before: the knob widens 20 pt from the edge but only a press on the drawn knob drags it, so columns 11 to 20 pt in widen and drag nothing (or drag a row). After: the knob widens exactly where a press grabs it, and every such drag scrolls the list. Record with: cmux-ci capture SHA --state scripts/cmux-next/media/states/scrollbar-grab-zone.json --video",
 "settings": {
  "appearance": {
   "metrics": {
    "sidebarWidth": 260
   }
  }
